'''Harbinger of Directions''' is a skill that summons an allied Harbinger [[minion]]. The skill is only available through {{il|The Fracturing Spinner}}.

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summoned Harbinger is immortal, and occasionally casts ''The Fracturing Spinner'' on the player. ''The Fracturing Spinner'' is a [[buff]] that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 8 seconds, and grants one or all of the following benefits:
* 1 additional Projectile
* +1 [[Chain]]
* [[Pierce]] 1 additional Target
* Projectiles [[Fork]]

==Drop restrictions==
Harbinger of Directions can only be obtained by equipping {{il|The Fracturing Spinner}}.

